{"id":162,"date":"2023-08-28T04:55:28","date_gmt":"2023-08-28T04:55:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/?post_type=solution&#038;p=162"},"modified":"2026-05-19T12:19:20","modified_gmt":"2026-05-19T04:19:20","slug":"ceramic-and-glass","status":"publish","type":"solution","link":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/solution\/ceramic-and-glass\/","title":{"rendered":"Ceramic and Glass"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Ceramic and glass production runs on precision. Kiln temperatures, roller integrity, and surface contact conditions all directly affect yield, defect rates, and line uptime. Vulcan Shield Global supplies alumina fiber solutions engineered for the sustained high-temperature environments where conventional insulation materials degrade and compromise output quality.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Applications<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul class=\"ul-listing\">\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Kiln Furniture Insulation<\/strong><br \/>\nMaintains dimensional stability under repeated thermal cycling, preventing heat transfer inconsistencies that cause uneven firing and increased product rejection rates.<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Roller Wrap and Pad Protection<\/strong><br \/>\nCushions contact between rollers and glass or ceramic surfaces during firing, reducing surface marking, micro-cracking, and defects while extending roller service life.<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Furnace Lining<\/strong><br \/>\nWithstands sustained temperatures up to 1600\u00b0C, stabilizing zone temperatures, reducing heat loss, and lowering energy consumption across the production cycle.<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Thermal Separation in Multi-Zone Kilns<\/strong><br \/>\nMaintains accurate thermal boundaries between kiln zones, preventing bleed that causes glaze inconsistencies, dimensional variance, and structural defects in finished products.<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Surface Protection for Delicate Glass<\/strong><br \/>\nProvides a heat-stable, low-abrasion interface between glass surfaces and kiln components, protecting optical clarity and surface finish in flat glass and specialty glass lines.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"\n<p>Provide heat-resistant lining to improve strength and heat-insulation performance.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":871,"parent":0,"menu_order":2,"template":"","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"cybocfi_hide_featured_image":"","_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"class_list":["post-162","solution","type-solution","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"aioseo_notices":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/solution\/162","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/solution"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/solution"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=162"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}